/T (2.1.3 Machine specification  EPILYUM  laser hair removal utilize the \( 755nm + 808nm + 1064nm \) the right wavelength to penetrate into the hair follicle. Using the theory of  selective laser absorption, laser can be preferentially absorbed by the melanin of the  hair. And then the hair shaft and the hair follicle are heated rapidly in order to destroy  the oxygen-supply organization of and around the hair follicle. The treatment window  of the handle is designed with sapphire dynamic cooling system, which could bring  about pain-free effect to the epidermis with pain free treatment. )
/E (2.1.3 Machine specification  EPILYUM  laser hair removal utilize the \( 755nm + 808nm + 1064nm \) the right wavelength to penetrate into the hair follicle. Using the theory of  selective laser absorption, laser can be preferentially absorbed by the melanin of the  hair. And then the hair shaft and the hair follicle are heated rapidly in order to destroy  the oxygen-supply organization of and around the hair follicle. The treatment window  of the handle is designed with sapphire dynamic cooling system, which could bring  about pain-free effect to the epidermis with pain free treatment. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
